MODULE: ReservationSurvivesCrashRetryDropsReservation
TARGET: ReservationSurvivesCrash
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an unsuccessful retry silently drops the durable alias reservation
PERTURBS: Retry

--- FIND
    /\ running' = TRUE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, maps, operation, phase, source, captured, copied, fenced,
--- REPLACE
    /\ running' = FALSE
    /\ operation' = "none"
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, maps, phase, source, captured, copied, fenced,
--- END
